{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46949","headline":"寄金陵幕中李郎中 · 齐己","name":"寄金陵幕中李郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"龙门支派富才能，年少飞翔便大鹏。\n久待尊罍临铁瓮，又从幢节镇金陵。\n精神一只秋空鹤，骚雅千寻夏井冰。\n长忆相招宿华馆，数宵忘寝尽寒灯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}